---
config:
  theme: base
description: one representative sequence diagram in the base theme
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web
  participant D@{ "type": "database" }
  box Back end
    participant A as API
  end
  U->>+W: open
  W->>A: request
  alt found
    A->>D: query
    D-->>A: rows
  else missing
    A--xW: not found
  end
  note over W,A: retries once
  A-)W: event
  W-->>-U: page
